.reviews"},"selected":false},"id":"tab-reviews","type":"TabBarItem"}]},"type":"TabBar"}]},"type":"Stack"}]},"type":"RootShell"},"name":"Overview: Activity","spec":{"accessibility":["The changes list is a named section; the base toggle is a group named Git base, and each changed resource names its status, kind and name in words. Each Review event is a link whose text is the sentence.","The failed lists are announced as alerts; a blocked merge-base option says why in words, never by color alone."],"constraints":["Built only from Adapter Widgets (Rail, NavItem, Button, Stack, Text, Icon, Alert, EmptyState, Skeleton, ListItem, SegmentedControl, Segment, TabBar and TabBarItem); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog. The shell is the one of the Overview View, and the changes list is the one of Changes since Git base.","The base toggle is a segmented control, the Review events are rows with a link button for the sentence, the real list is a timeline. The strings of the app are copied under the same Locale keys where one exists; the panel's own strings are English literals until issue #492 adds their Locale keys (a Locale change stales every formal capture). Parameters are the Widget values; the sentences of Review events name the actor and the place, and the excerpts and relative times are sample content.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A member opened the Overview with ?tab=activity; the tab strip lists Views, Checks, Decisions, Requirements (only with a requirement source of the spec kind) and Activity, and Activity is the selected one.","The base state compares the working tree with HEAD: three resources changed (a modified View, an added View and a removed Locale) and six Review events follow. Variants show the changes loading, empty or unavailable because git cannot supply the base, the merge-base option, and the Review events loading, failing or empty.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the Workbench chrome follows the Workbench language, so its text is baked here per Locale. Names, actors, times and excerpts are sample content."],"intent":"Show the Activity tab of the Overview as built from Adapter Widgets only: the canonical resources added, changed or removed since the Git base, and, apart from it, the latest Review events, so a person can see what moved without opening each View.","interactionRules":["The changes list is the read-only view of Changes since Git base for the whole Workspace: each canonical resource added, changed or removed since the base, with its status, kind and name; the base is HEAD, or the merge base with the default branch on the toggle, and selecting a row shows its semantic differences as the View Changes since Git base draws them.","When git cannot supply the base the list says so with Retry and lists nothing, and the Review events stay.","Review events are a separate list below the changes and are never interleaved with them: the Workbench reads them live from the latest threads (comments, replies, submissions, resolutions, reopenings and re-anchoring), each linking to its thread.","A list that is loading shows placeholders, a list that fails says so with Retry and never shows stale rows, and with no Review activity the list says so."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"label":"P1: Version history is Git's (Discussion #491), owner acceptance","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/491#discussioncomment-19699447"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"2e2f88d6-7a95-424a-b3d4-4661d811ef13"},{"relation":"changes","type":"view","viewId":"a4c1d702-6e2b-4f3a-9d5c-2b7e1f8a0c02"}],"requirements":["01a11a5e-1946-7217-aff5-db13df3a2977","01a11e0d-db86-7890-ac42-5b4079364ad2","01a1ece7-8e23-77a8-9f34-b9c479043ca8","01a1ece7-8fe1-7d17-8ef4-c706259e5331"]},"variants":{"changes-empty":{"requirements":["01a1ece7-8e23-77a8-9f34-b9c479043ca8"],"state":{"empty-state":{"visible":true},"summary":{"visible":false}}},"changes-loading":{"state":{"loading":{"visible":true},"summary":{"visible":false}}},"git-unavailable":{"requirements":["01a1ece7-92cf-79d6-b7d0-1d907da0045b"],"state":{"failed-alert":{"visible":true},"summary":{"visible":false}}},"merge-base":{"requirements":["01a1ece7-907a-74bb-9602-d9edcce38e42"],"state":{"base-head":{"selected":false},"base-merge":{"selected":true},"base-note":{"visible":false},"base-note-merge":{"visible":true}}},"review-empty":{"requirements":["01a11e0d-db86-7890-ac42-5b4079364ad2"],"state":{"rv-empty":{"visible":true},"rv-list":{"visible":false}}},"review-failed":{"state":{"rv-failed":{"visible":true},"rv-list":{"visible":false}}},"review-loading":{"state":{"rv-list":{"visible":false},"rv-loading":{"visible":true}}}}}
